 157:             # (a.2) Keep a sanity upper bound so a future miscount cannot slip through unnoticed.
 158:             #       The bound is deliberately generous against real growth: the honest count here
 159:             #       is ~1k and rises a few dozen files per round as receipts land under `.hgk/`.
 160:             #       A genuine `.git`-internals miscount is a MANY-THOUSANDS jump (packed objects,
